<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cypress Semi lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cypress Semi lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Schroder Wertheim said it downgraded Cypress Semiconductor Corp to &quot;perform in line&quot; from &quot;outperform.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 3/8 to 12.</p>
